{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本愛媛縣西條市有太鼓花車翻側，壓死副市長。</p><p></p><p>事發於昨日下午接近六時，西條市舉行從江戶時代延續至今的西條祭，一部5.5米高、約3公噸重的太鼓花車突然翻側，壓著有份參與、62歲的副市長波江明廣，送院後證實不治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T15:39:00.811006+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:37:34.499315+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T15:37:34.369651+00:00","content_hash":"21299a73fb39ba69d22eedc8b7cb45def5441b77d19d45b0b151ad048781e441","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}